type: software
title: "k11 Release Readiness Agent"
abstract: "Claude Code plugin that answers 'can we ship this branch?': it plans the checks a change needs, gathers evidence in parallel sub-agents using six open-source MCP servers (Playwright QA, Selenium QA, API Contract QA, API Functional QA, LLM Assure and Release Gate), and returns the Release Gate's deterministic, evidence-backed verdict."
